bject. No prose, no explanation, no code fences.\r\n\r\nprompt:\r\n{\r\n  \"budget\": 29,\r\n  \"orders\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"hi\": 30,\r\n      \"lo\": 12,\r\n      \"w\": 1\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"hi\": 30,\r\n      \"lo\": 18,\r\n      \"w\": 1\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"properties\": [\r\n    \"bounds\",\r\n    \"sum\",\r\n    \"proportionality\",\r\n    \"binding-bounds\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"request\": \"Return only the required allocation JSON.\"\r\n}\r\nReturn only the required JSON object. No prose.",
